solidcraft-render-server

A modified build of SolidCraft v0.42.0 (https://github.com/tangency-labs/solidcraft, tag v0.42.0).
Source of this build: https://github.com/jianzhichun/solidz-render-server

Changes against SolidCraft v0.42.0:
- new: apps/solidcraft-render-server (this program: the editing UI drawn offscreen and streamed to
  an embedding host)
- moved: the desktop app's control protocol implementation, from apps/solidcraft/src/control_server.rs
  to crates/ui-egui/src/control_protocol.rs
- changed: crates/engine (a process-wide host read-only switch, crates/engine/src/read_only.rs,
  checked in Session::execute)
- changed: xtask/src/layers.rs (registers the new app), Cargo.lock (the new package)

Licences are SolidCraft's, unchanged: the code is under the MIT License or the Apache License 2.0
(LICENSE-MIT, LICENSE-APACHE; NOTICE). This program links SolidCraft's UI kit, look and theme, which
are under the SolidCraft Brand and Interface Licence (LICENSE-BRAND). The licences of the third-party
crates built into it are in THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.txt.
